{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02148","headline":"杂曲歌辞 杨柳枝 一 · 皇甫松","name":"杂曲歌辞 杨柳枝 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春入行宫映翠微，玄宗侍女舞烟丝。\n如今柳向空城绿，玉笛何人更把吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}